Subject: [PATCH] Rotate all GEMINI_API_KEY* on 429; round-robin across 5-6+
 keys

- Discover every env var starting with GEMINI_API_KEY (no limit)
- Round-robin start position per request to spread load before quota hits
- Ask AI uses full key pool (was only collecting 2-3 keys)
- Startup logs all env var names + unique key count
